title: United Front Policy
choose-if: united_front_policy_timer = 0 and not united_front_broken
unavailable-subtitle: [? if united_front_policy_timer != 0: It is too early to change this policy again ?][? if united_front_broken: The United Front has already collapsed ?]
on-arrival: united_front_policy_timer = 8

= United Front Policy

- @support_ccp
- @build_support_ccp
- @cont_support_ccp
- @small_support_ccp
- @build_small_support_ccp
- @cont_small_support_ccp
- @anti_ccp
- @build_anti_ccp
- @cont_ant_ccp
- @root: We shouldn't change our stance at the moment
- @ideology: Let us change a different stance

@support_ccp
title: Fully embrace our Communist partners
subtitle: Our revolutionary struggle is one in the same, despite any differences. 
view-if: united_front_policy != -1
choose-if: (ccp_dual_members_strength + left_strength) > (center_strength + right_strength)
unavailable-subtitle: This position is far too radical for our party to stomach
on-arrival: ccp_dual_members_strength += 20; ccp_relation += 20; united_front_policy = -1

We announce a policy of total cooperation with the Communist Party, and the unity of our struggle to liberate China from its oppression.

@build_support_ccp
title: Increase support for the United Front
subtitle: Our revolutionary struggle is one in the same, despite any differences. 
view-if: united_front_policy != -1 and (ccp_dual_members_strength + left_strength) < (center_strength + right_strength)
on-arrival: left_strength += 5

We are building support in the party for the United Front so that we may eventually build a stronger bond between our parties.

@cont_support_ccp
title: Fully embrace our Communist partners
subtitle: Our revolutionary struggle is one in the same, despite any differences. 
view-if: united_front_policy = -1
on-arrival: left_strength += 5

We continue our policy of supporting the United Front.

@small_support_ccp
title: The CCP are useful allies, but our parties are separate and distinct
subtitle: Our causes are aligned for the moment and we should work together to achieve them, but the fundamental ideological differences between our parties are irreconcilable. 
view-if: united_front_policy != 0
choose-if: left_strength > right_strength
unavailable-subtitle: The party is too radicalized against Communism to support this policy
on-arrival: ccp_dual_members_strength += 5; ccp_relation += 25; united_front_policy = 0

The Communist Party make for useful allies in the National Revolution, but they must remember who is the junior partner in this relationship.

@build_small_support_ccp
title: Build up support for the United Front
subtitle: The Communists, despite our differences, are useful allies and we need their support.
view-if: united_front_policy != 0
choose-if: right_strength > left_strength
on-arrival: ccp_dual_members_strength += 5; ccp_relation += 25;

The party is still aligned against the United Front, we must work to change their minds

@cont_small_support_ccp
title: Continue maintaining the United Front
subtitle: Our causes are aligned for the moment and we should work together to achieve them, but the fundamental ideological differences between our parties are irreconcilable. 
view-if: united_front_policy = 0
on-arrival: ccp_dual_members_strength += 5; ccp_relation += 25;

The Communist Party make for useful allies in the National Revolution, but they must remember who is the junior partner in this relationship.

@anti_ccp
title: The CCP have become a danger and can no longer be tolerated
subtitle: The Communist Party and their Soviet puppetmasters are little more than tools of imperialist incursion and societal destruction.
view-if: united_front_policy != 1
choose-if: right_strength > left_strength
unavailable-subtitle: The CCP is too useful an ally to abandon
on-arrival: ccp_dual_members_strength -= 5; ccp_relation -= 25; united_front_policy = 1

We must rid the party and China of Communist influence as quickly and as thoroughly as possible.

@build_anti_ccp
title: Polemicize against the CCP
subtitle: The Communists cannot be trusted, we just need to make everyone else realize that.
view-if: united_front_policy != 1
choose-if: left_strength > right_strength
on-arrival: ccp_dual_members_strength -= 5; ccp_relation -= 25

By propagandizing against the Communists and their allies, we can sway opinions against them.

@cont_ant_ccp
title: Continue anti-Communist policy
subtitle: Rally the party against Communist influence
view-if: united_front_policy = 1
on-arrival: ccp_dual_members_strength -= 5; ccp_relation -= 25

We must rid the party and China of Communist influence as quickly and as thoroughly as possible.
